===Belgium vs Panama===
The two teams had never met before this World Cup match.<ref name=Kit>{{cite web|url=https://resources.fifa.com/image/upload/2018-fifa-world-cup-russiatm-statistical-kit.pdf?cloudid=fjqkfby8aur1lxnvnxdi|title=2018 FIFA World Cup – Statistical Kit|publisher=FIFA|url-status=dead|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180513163755/http://resources.fifa.com/image/upload/2018-fifa-world-cup-russiatm-statistical-kit.pdf?cloudid=fjqkfby8aur1lxnvnxdi|archive-date=13 May 2018|df=dmy-all}}</ref>

[[Yannick Carrasco]] and [[Dries Mertens]] forced early saves from goalkeeper [[Jaime Penedo]]. [[Eden Hazard]] hit the side-netting after pouncing on a loose backpass from [[Román Torres]]. Hazard fired wide in the 26th minute and was left hobbling by heavy challenges from [[Michael Amir Murillo]] and Torres. Hazard then shook off the blows and forced Penedo into a save with his legs.<ref name="Goal Belgium v Panama">{{cite web |last=Smith |first=Jamie |title=Mertens magic sets up Group G win |url=http://www.goal.com/en-qa/match/belgium-v-panama/report/e39pyss79n96zilluineihiax |website=Goal.com |date=18 June 2018 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180618230524/http://www.goal.com/en-qa/match/belgium-v-panama/report/e39pyss79n96zilluineihiax |archive-date=18 June 2018 |df=dmy-all }}</ref> After a goalless first half, Mertens steered in a right-foot volley from the right of the penalty area to give Belgium the lead.<ref>{{cite web |last=Emons |first=Michael |title=Belgium 3 Panama 0 |url=https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/44434275 |work=BBC Sport |date=18 June 2018 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180619023629/https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/44434275 |archive-date=19 June 2018 |df=dmy-all }}</ref> [[Kevin De Bruyne]] almost doubled the lead but narrowly missed the target with a 25-yard free-kick that curled away from Penedo's right-hand post. Belgium doubled their lead in the 69th minute after [[Romelu Lukaku]] scored with a diving header after a cross from the left by Kevin De Bruyne. Lukaku then added a third with a chipped finish from the left of the penalty area after a through ball from Hazard.<ref name="Goal Belgium v Panama"/>

Belgium's last victory by two goals or more at the FIFA World Cup was a [[1990 FIFA World Cup Group E#Belgium vs Uruguay|3–1]] defeat of Uruguay in 1990. It also matched their best win in World Cup history, along with a [[1970 FIFA World Cup Group 1#Belgium vs El Salvador|3–0]] victory over [[El Salvador]] in 1970.<ref name="BEL-PAN recap">{{cite web |url=https://inside.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2018russia/news/belgium-prevail-over-gritty-panama-2961030 |title=Belgium prevail over gritty Panama |publisher=FIFA |date=18 June 2018 |access-date=18 June 2018 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260520044610/https://inside.fifa.com/tournaments/mens/worldcup/2018russia/news/belgium-prevail-over-gritty-panama-2961030 |archive-date=20 May 2026}}</ref>

